    "fixtureContent": "All people, posts and Reath works shown are disposable local browser verification fixtures; the normal preview seeds no community posts.",
    "checks": [
      "Studio metadata points to the deterministic EGGS initial icon, which returns HTTP 200 as SVG.",
      "Reath project card opens the internal Digest reading room; the actual Reath logo loads.",
      "Editor saves and previews a Funnies draft; publisher explicitly publishes; real Reath collections filter publications without embedding third-party video.",
